Rule 5 (list or tuple axis must have unique dimensions)
{v_2 : list(int) ⊎ tuple(int)} |= ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : ∀j ∈ [i + 1, v_2.len - 1] : v_2[i] ≠ v_2[j]
